---
/**
 * The open-source CLI path, placed right under the hero so the first thing a
 * visitor learns is that they can run the same checks themselves.
 */
import { Copy } from '@lucide/astro';
import { AFDOCS_REPO_URL, AFDOCS_SITE_URL, AUTHOR_URL, SPEC_URL } from '@lib/agent-score/meta';

const command = 'npx afdocs@latest check https://docs.example.com --format scorecard';
---

<section class="pl-as-section pl-as-section-tight" id="run-it-yourself" aria-labelledby="pl-as-diy-title">
  <div class="pl-as-diy">
    <div>
      <h2 class="pl-as-h2" id="pl-as-diy-title">Run it yourself</h2>
      <p class="pl-as-lede">
        Agent Score is a hosted run of afdocs. The same command in your terminal runs the same checks with the same
        scoring. Add <code>--fixes</code> to get a fix for every issue. Requires Node 22 or later.
      </p>
      <p class="pl-as-credit">
        <a href={AFDOCS_REPO_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track-action="view_afdocs" data-track-funnel="education" data-track-location="agent_score_diy">afdocs</a>{' '}
        is open source (MIT) by{' '}
        <a href={AUTHOR_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track-action="view_afdocs_author" data-track-funnel="education" data-track-location="agent_score_diy">Dachary Carey</a>{' '}
        and implements the{' '}
        <a href={SPEC_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track-action="view_agent_docs_spec" data-track-funnel="education" data-track-location="agent_score_diy">Agent-Friendly Docs Spec</a>.
        Promptless did not write it. We run it.
      </p>
      <ul class="pl-as-links">
        <li><a href={AFDOCS_REPO_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/agent-ecosystem/afdocs</a></li>
        <li><a href={AFDOCS_SITE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">afdocs.dev</a></li>
        <li><a href={SPEC_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">agentdocsspec.com</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="pl-as-terminal pl-as-terminal-lg">
      <div class="pl-as-terminal-bar">
        <span class="pl-as-terminal-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
        <span class="pl-as-terminal-title pl-as-mono-label">terminal</span>
        <button class="pl-as-btn pl-as-btn-ghost" type="button" data-as-copy data-as-copy-text={command} aria-label="Copy the afdocs command">
          <Copy size={14} aria-hidden="true" /><span data-as-copy-label>Copy</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <pre class="pl-as-scorecard-preview"><code><span class="pl-as-prompt">$ </span><span class="pl-as-strong">{command}</span>

Agent-Friendly Docs Scorecard
==============================

  Overall Score: <span class="pl-as-strong">82 / 100 (B)</span>

  Content Discoverability        74 / 100 (C)
  Markdown Availability          63 / 100 (D)
  Page Size and Truncation Risk  92 / 100 (A)
  <span class="pl-as-comment">…</span>

  <span class="pl-as-warn">WARN</span>  llms-txt-directive-html   No llms.txt directive found…
  <span class="pl-as-ok">PASS</span>  rendering-strategy        All 50 sampled pages contain…</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
